/config/plugins.yml
/modes/_profile.md
/modes/_custom.md
/modes/_brief.md
/.mcp.json
/plugins.local/
/plugins.lock

# No testing or demonstration artifacts are distributed.
**/tests/
**/test/
**/fixtures/
**/__tests__/
**/__mocks__/
